      "post_id": "82669",
      "author_handle": "milkymum",
      "date_as_displayed": "Posted 17 years 3 weeks ago",
      "body": "I am in the process of building my on-line website. Once I have the website built I will be then up-loading it to webspace and will findout what the rules are here about promoting your business. I am enjoying building my website and I think the thing that is keepingme going is the fact that I have choosen an area that is personal to me. My daughter adores care-bears and they are so hard to find in the and so is strawberry short-cake. I have got feed-up with having to pay over the odds for them from america that I decided this would be  avery proimsing rewarding area to do business in. My EJ does take naps anymore but when he does on the very rare occassion he will fall asleep on a cushion on the lounge floor.",
